about:
I am a digital transformation specialist who believes that technology and data are often underutilized assets that have the ability to rewrite a company’s competitive narrative. I have spent over 20 years advising CIOs and CDOs on the building blocks of their capabilities and how to leverage the value of their data and technologies.

I have built digital and analytics capability for
...100+ year-old legacy brands, startups and new IPOs alike;
...in developed and developing markets in China, Hong Kong, Singapore, US, Latam and Europe;
...across the physical, the digital only, and sometimes merging the divide;
...most often for retail and consumer focused CDOs, CIOs and CMOs.

Aside from nurturing a career where I get to work on interesting problems with people that inspire me, I am passionate about mentoring, supporting and building up other women in technology, women in leadership, and women role models.

